---

SUMMARY

All SVG diagrams, graphical elements, photos, and render images in the graphical
build guide are licensed under CC BY 4.0. This permissive license allows use,
remix, and redistribution with attribution.

**Key permissions:**
  • Use and adapt the diagrams freely
  • Commercial use allowed
  • Remix and republish
  • Must provide attribution

**Key obligations:**
  • Credit the original Serenity UAV Project
  • Indicate if you made changes to the diagrams
  • Preserve the license notice

---

REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION FORMAT

When using or adapting these diagrams, include:

  "Diagrams based on Serenity UAV Graphical Build Guide
   (https://github.com/[repo]/graphical-build-guide),
   licensed under CC BY 4.0.
   Changes: [describe modifications, if any]."

For SVG files with embedded metadata, add a comment block:

  <!-- Design by Serenity UAV Project; CC BY 4.0 -->
  <!-- Modifications: [date, description] -->
  <!-- See ../docs/attribution_and_licensing.md -->

---

DIAGRAM ORGANIZATION

All SVG files in this directory follow CC BY 4.0:

  build_guide_NN_*.svg  — Phase-by-phase assembly guides
  overview_*.svg        — Vehicle overview and component breakdown
  LEGEND.svg            — Symbol reference and color coding
  flight_phases/        — Flight test sequence documentation

---

FAIR USE & EXCEPTIONS

The following materials used in diagrams retain their original licenses:

  • Third-party component symbols — Follow component supplier licenses
  • FreeCAD/Blender-derived geometry — Derived from our CERN-OHL-W hardware designs
  • Standard callout fonts — System fonts (CC0 or permissive)
  • Background patterns — Serenity UAV project original (CC BY 4.0)

